  <div class="takeaways">
    <h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Yes, you can earn a sports psychology degree online from accredited universities at the master's and doctoral level, with coursework delivered remotely.</li>
      <li>Supervised applied experience cannot be completed entirely on screen. Ask how each program structures practicum hours and local placements before you enroll.</li>
